WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:08.875
NARRATOR: The return
of the prodigal sons,

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:11.511
hungry and humiliated.

00:00:11.578 --> 00:00:14.781
[music playing]

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:32.565
Just as Tata expected,
she welcomes them back,

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.235
willing to forgive and forget.

00:00:44.677 --> 00:00:49.749
But the boys must pull
their weight and work

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:51.618
for the good of the pride.

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:55.021
[tense music]

00:00:55.088 --> 00:01:00.126
They must learn
precision hunting.

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:01.795
And she is their teacher.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:16.776
[tense music]

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:31.958
Tata holds her nerve,
a model of restraint.

00:01:32.025 --> 00:01:34.794
[tense music]

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:46.673
The warthogs are oblivious
and the teenagers gripped.

00:01:46.739 --> 00:01:50.677
Watch and learn, boys.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:54.180
[tense music]

00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:35.121
A masterclass in execution.

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:48.001
But someone wants more
than the lion's share.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.803
[growling and roaring]

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:55.942
He wants it all.

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:09.155
[tense music]

00:03:12.458 --> 00:03:16.896
This meal is his, and his alone.

